# A task image's build sees only the files its Dockerfile copies, so no hidden test, reference solution, shortcut or
# other file a task holds can enter an image. Each level is closed, then reopened for its build inputs alone, since
# a builder does not search a closed folder for a reopened file.
*
!pi
pi/*
!pi/install.sh
!pi/package.json
!pi/package-lock.json
!tasks
tasks/*
!tasks/dandegate-literal-paths
!tasks/dandegate-unicode-lines
!tasks/design-read-fenced-code
tasks/*/*
!tasks/*/environment
tasks/*/environment/*
!tasks/*/environment/Dockerfile
!tasks/*/environment/start.patch
!tasks/*/environment/AGENTS.md
!tasks/*/environment/gitignore
